      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's like i don't even exist anymore. i woke up today and realized none of them even talk to me anymore, not even to argue, just absolute silence. it's like i've been deleted from everyone's lives. i'm just walking around as a ghost but i'm still stuck in this body. it feels so fake.",
